{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cab05ed3cd665f40f58001ab4349f32cf93126ae8aad7cb3fc4364ebfc175125",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45415afa1928dd30c349667ae9b892e0ae9b19574e898fb94a040075abcbe27a",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n今天谢谢你送来的点心慰劳品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89315a7fab75e8510c5b11d9768a53c75af87c41c8c026e619e50db378e6af48",
      "text": "多亏了你派对办得很开心。但是呢，回去之后胡思乱想了一通，总觉得稍微有点落寞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48f3c892544f5875098857779caecee90fe86f0ac95e00fe83fff5896433129c",
      "text": "你要是方便的话，\n能陪我通会儿电话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d84ede1c415918e6767334b3246a6950ab091359887924142e8d65336876e17",
      "text": "嗯，可以的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c3128a6d28cd4c73e0512c4d2fff6c41abc1c9f30890891721558dd9ef6a06",
      "text": "谢啦。……今天在派对上，\n我和前辈们一起看了动画电影。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:060b9b5fe8a0aae27fef9b4da46a7768e9ba3363a5e29efa3d0280decaa31a26",
      "text": "内容超级精彩，\n大家看完之后感想都根本停不下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a0e9dae4ebcb494cabd6596dd0154aa83f01a299b84bc97009cbbff497200db",
      "text": "……在别人眼里，\n我好像总给人一种很难搭话的气场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d38a20734d2ae5e555d22bb2a6ba2dfe526392969154073ec2e1b6cb87e360",
      "text": "但你却完全不在意那些，\n无论何时都以真心与我相待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cccfb40f352645801324fb6b25a5ccb27bcb750a3d140fa654f0685bdcc4fe36",
      "text": "我也会为了改正自己不好的地方而努力的。\n……拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "那是当然！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca18c959bfc38c96f3cf9294348db0a8b06c5b09deec076d9ea08ada8a499ba",
      "text": "嗯。……嘛，不过就算这样，\n要是你太得意忘形的话，我还是会说教你的就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3fe879171ca61850832c533c5c4d5a29c98730b577ac9cc536b69179628582",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该挂了。\n和你聊完之后，心情舒畅多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_2_047_22_t01:1_2_047_22_t01:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfd51245ae01e559113f6170fa5c579b3798853629e6760af6b8a92c2982e366",
      "text": "我明天开始也会展现出更多的成长。\n好好期待着吧。挂啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
